    <item>
      <title>[翻译] TLDR AI: Opus 4.7 加速⚡、Qwen Image 2.0 🖼️、无服务器GPU ✨</title>
      <link>https://tldr.tech/ai/2026-05-13</link>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;标签:&lt;/strong&gt; #AI安全 #安全框架 #合规治理&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;摘要:&lt;/strong&gt; SANS推出的AI安全成熟度模型为企业提供了一套五阶段系统化评估框架，对齐NIST、EU AI Act等主流合规标准。该模型通过基于证据的评分机制与可落地的分步指引，帮助团队精准评估现状并稳步提升AI安全防护能力。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="color:#888;font-size:13px;"&gt;原标题: Opus 4.7 Fast ⚡, Qwen Image 2.0 🖼️, serverless GPUs ✨&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr/&gt;
&lt;h3 style="margin:24px 0 12px;"&gt;Opus 4.7 Fast ⚡, Qwen Image 2.0 🖼️, serverless GPUs ✨&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style="color:#2c2c2e;margin:4px 0 24px;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;"&gt;Opus 4.7 Fast ⚡、Qwen Image 2.0 🖼️、serverless GPUs ✨&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div style="color:#9a9ea6;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;margin:20px 0 6px;"&gt;&lt;strong style="color:#c0392b;background:#fdf2f2;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;"&gt;AI security&lt;/strong&gt; is on everyone's mind - but few have a &lt;strong style="color:#c0392b;background:#fdf2f2;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;"&gt;roadmap&lt;/strong&gt; they can stand behind.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p style="color:#2c2c2e;margin:4px 0 24px;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;"&gt;&lt;strong style="color:#c0392b;background:#fdf2f2;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;"&gt;AI security&lt;/strong&gt;（AI 安全）是所有人关注的焦点——但很少有人拥有一份能够真正信赖的 &lt;strong style="color:#c0392b;background:#fdf2f2;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;"&gt;roadmap&lt;/strong&gt;（路线图）。&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div style="color:#9a9ea6;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;margin:20px 0 6px;"&gt;The &lt;strong style="color:#2471a3;background:#eaf4fd;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;"&gt;SANS&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong style="color:#c0392b;background:#fdf2f2;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;"&gt;AI Security Maturity Model&lt;/strong&gt; helps you to assess your current stage and progress with confidence using a &lt;strong style="color:#c0392b;background:#fdf2f2;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;"&gt;5-stage framework&lt;/strong&gt; with defined &lt;strong style="color:#c0392b;background:#fdf2f2;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;"&gt;controls&lt;/strong&gt;, metrics, and actions:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p style="color:#2c2c2e;margin:4px 0 24px;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;"&gt;&lt;strong style="color:#2471a3;background:#eaf4fd;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;"&gt;SANS&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong style="color:#c0392b;background:#fdf2f2;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;"&gt;AI Security Maturity Model&lt;/strong&gt;（AI 安全成熟度模型）可帮助您通过包含明确定义的 &lt;strong style="color:#c0392b;background:#fdf2f2;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;"&gt;controls&lt;/strong&gt;（控制措施）、指标和行动的 &lt;strong style="color:#c0392b;background:#fdf2f2;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;"&gt;5-stage framework&lt;/strong&gt;（五阶段框架），自信地评估当前所处阶段并稳步推进。&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div style="color:#9a9ea6;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;margin:20px 0 6px;"&gt;
  &lt;ul style="list-style:none;padding-left:0;"&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;✅ Mapped to &lt;strong style="color:#c0392b;background:#fdf2f2;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;"&gt;NIST AI RMF&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong style="color:#c0392b;background:#fdf2f2;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;"&gt;EU AI Act&lt;/strong&gt;, ISO 42001, and &lt;strong style="color:#c0392b;background:#fdf2f2;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;"&gt;OWASP&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;✅ &lt;strong style="color:#c0392b;background:#fdf2f2;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;"&gt;Evidenced-based scoring models&lt;/strong&gt; across Protect, Govern, and Utilize&lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;✅ Step-by-step guidance your team can immediately apply&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p style="color:#2c2c2e;margin:4px 0 24px;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;"&gt;
  ✅ 映射至 &lt;strong style="color:#c0392b;background:#fdf2f2;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;"&gt;NIST AI RMF&lt;/strong&gt;（NIST AI 风险管理框架）、&lt;strong style="color:#c0392b;background:#fdf2f2;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;"&gt;EU AI Act&lt;/strong&gt;（欧盟人工智能法案）、ISO 42001 及 &lt;strong style="color:#c0392b;background:#fdf2f2;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;"&gt;OWASP&lt;/strong&gt; 标准&lt;br/&gt;
  ✅ 覆盖 Protect（保护）、Govern（治理）与 Utilize（利用）的 &lt;strong style="color:#c0392b;background:#fdf2f2;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;"&gt;evidenced-based scoring models&lt;/strong&gt;（循证评分模型）&lt;br/&gt;
  ✅ 您的团队可立即落地的分步指导
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div style="color:#9a9ea6;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;margin:20px 0 6px;"&gt;Download the &lt;strong style="color:#c0392b;background:#fdf2f2;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;"&gt;SANS AI Security Maturity Model eBook&lt;/strong&gt; by &lt;strong style="color:#2471a3;background:#eaf4fd;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;"&gt;Chris Cochran&lt;/strong&gt;, Field CISO and VP of AI Security&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p style="color:#2c2c2e;margin:4px 0 24px;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;"&gt;下载由 &lt;strong style="color:#2471a3;background:#eaf4fd;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;"&gt;Chris Cochran&lt;/strong&gt;（现场 CISO 兼 AI 安全副总裁）撰写的 &lt;strong style="color:#c0392b;background:#fdf2f2;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;"&gt;SANS AI Security Maturity Model eBook&lt;/strong&gt;（SANS AI 安全成熟度模型电子书）。&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div style="color:#9a9ea6;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;margin:20px 0 6px;"&gt;Browse more &lt;strong style="color:#2471a3;background:#eaf4fd;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;"&gt;SANS&lt;/strong&gt; AI resources for ways to build, break, and defend AI in &lt;strong style="color:#c0392b;background:#fdf2f2;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;"&gt;production&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p style="color:#2c2c2e;margin:4px 0 24px;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;"&gt;浏览更多 &lt;strong style="color:#2471a3;background:#eaf4fd;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;"&gt;SANS&lt;/strong&gt; AI 资源，了解如何在 &lt;strong style="color:#c0392b;background:#fdf2f2;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;"&gt;production&lt;/strong&gt;（生产环境）中构建、攻破和防御 AI。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr/&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🔗 &lt;a href="https://tldr.tech/ai/2026-05-13"&gt;阅读原文&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://tldr.tech/ai/2026-05-13</guid>
      <pubDate>Wed, 13 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>[翻译] Simon Willison: Datasette 1.0a29 发布说明</title>
      <link>https://simonwillison.net/2026/May/12/datasette/#atom-everything</link>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;标签:&lt;/strong&gt; #Datasette #版本发布 #Bug修复&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;摘要:&lt;/strong&gt; Datasette 发布 1.0a29 版本，新增用于创建 &amp;quot;_r&amp;quot; 字典的实用工具方法并优化了空表展示，同时修复了 Mobile Safari 显示异常及测试时因连接关闭竞态条件导致的段错误崩溃。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="color:#888;font-size:13px;"&gt;原标题: datasette 1.0a29&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr/&gt;
&lt;h3 style="margin:24px 0 12px;"&gt;Release: datasette 1.0a29&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style="color:#2c2c2e;margin:4px 0 24px;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;"&gt;发布：&lt;strong style="color:#2471a3;background:#eaf4fd;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;"&gt;datasette&lt;/strong&gt; 1.0a29&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div style="color:#9a9ea6;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;margin:20px 0 6px;"&gt;
&lt;blockquote style="border-left:3px solid #c0c0c0;padding:8px 16px;margin:8px 0;background:#f9f9fb;"&gt;
&lt;strong style="color:#c0392b;background:#fdf2f2;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;"&gt;NewTokenRestrictions&lt;/strong&gt;.abbreviated(datasette)utility methodfor creating"_r"dictionaries.#2695Table headers and column options are now visible even if a table contains zero rows.#2701Fixed bug with display of column actions dialog on Mobile Safari.#2708Fixed bug where tests could crash with a segfault due to a race condition betweenDatasette.close()andDatabase.close().#2709
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p style="color:#2c2c2e;margin:4px 0 24px;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;"&gt;
新增 &lt;strong style="color:#c0392b;background:#fdf2f2;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;"&gt;NewTokenRestrictions&lt;/strong&gt;.abbreviated(datasette) 工具方法，用于创建 &lt;code style="background:#f0f0f5;padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;font-size:13px;"&gt;"_r"&lt;/code&gt; 字典。#2695 即使表格包含零行，现在也会显示表头和列选项。#2701 修复了在 &lt;strong style="color:#2471a3;background:#eaf4fd;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;"&gt;Mobile Safari&lt;/strong&gt; 上列操作对话框显示异常的问题。#2708 修复了由于 &lt;code style="background:#f0f0f5;padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;font-size:13px;"&gt;Datasette.close()&lt;/code&gt; 与 &lt;code style="background:#f0f0f5;padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;font-size:13px;"&gt;Database.close()&lt;/code&gt; 之间存在 race condition（竞态条件）而导致测试可能因 segfault（段错误）崩溃的缺陷。#2709
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div style="color:#9a9ea6;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;margin:20px 0 6px;"&gt;
&lt;ul style="margin:0;padding-left:20px;"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong style="color:#c0392b;background:#fdf2f2;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;"&gt;NewTokenRestrictions&lt;/strong&gt;.abbreviated(datasette)utility methodfor creating"_r"dictionaries.#2695&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Table headers and column options are now visible even if a table contains zero rows.#2701&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed bug with display of column actions dialog on &lt;strong style="color:#2471a3;background:#eaf4fd;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;"&gt;Mobile Safari&lt;/strong&gt;.#2708&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed bug where tests could crash with a segfault due to a race condition betweenDatasette.close()andDatabase.close().#2709&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p style="color:#2c2c2e;margin:4px 0 24px;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;"&gt;
• 新增 &lt;strong style="color:#c0392b;background:#fdf2f2;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;"&gt;NewTokenRestrictions&lt;/strong&gt;.abbreviated(datasette) 工具方法，用于创建 &lt;code style="background:#f0f0f5;padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;font-size:13px;"&gt;"_r"&lt;/code&gt; 字典。#2695&lt;br&gt;
• 即使表格包含零行，表头和列选项现在也会显示。#2701&lt;br&gt;
• 修复了在 &lt;strong style="color:#2471a3;background:#eaf4fd;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;"&gt;Mobile Safari&lt;/strong&gt; 上列操作对话框显示异常的问题。#2708&lt;br&gt;
• 修复了由于 &lt;code style="background:#f0f0f5;padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;font-size:13px;"&gt;Datasette.close()&lt;/code&gt; 与 &lt;code style="background:#f0f0f5;padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;font-size:13px;"&gt;Database.close()&lt;/code&gt; 之间存在 race condition（竞态条件）而导致测试可能因 segfault（段错误）崩溃的缺陷。#2709
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div style="color:#9a9ea6;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;margin:20px 0 6px;"&gt;
That segfault bug wasgnarly. I added a mechanism to Datasette recently that would automatically close connections at the end of each test, but it turned out that introduced a race condition where an in-flight query could sometimes be executing in a thread against a connection while it was being closed. I ended up solving that by having Codex CLI (with GPT-5.5 xhigh) createa minimal Dockerfilethat recreated the bug.
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p style="color:#2c2c2e;margin:4px 0 24px;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;"&gt;
那个 segfault（段错误）缺陷非常棘手。我最近为 &lt;strong style="color:#2471a3;background:#eaf4fd;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;"&gt;Datasette&lt;/strong&gt; 添加了一个机制，可以在每次测试结束时自动关闭连接，但结果这引入了 race condition（竞态条件）：有时一个正在执行的查询可能正在某个线程中针对连接运行，而与此同时该连接正在被关闭。我最终通过让 &lt;strong style="color:#2471a3;background:#eaf4fd;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;"&gt;Codex CLI&lt;/strong&gt;（配合 &lt;strong style="color:#2471a3;background:#eaf4fd;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;"&gt;GPT-5.5 xhigh&lt;/strong&gt;）创建一个最小化的 &lt;strong style="color:#c0392b;background:#fdf2f2;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;"&gt;Dockerfile&lt;/strong&gt; 来重现该缺陷，从而解决了这个问题。
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div style="color:#9a9ea6;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;margin:20px 0 6px;"&gt;
Tags: projects, datasette
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p style="color:#2c2c2e;margin:4px 0 24px;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;"&gt;
标签：projects, &lt;strong style="color:#2471a3;background:#eaf4fd;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;"&gt;datasette&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr/&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🔗 &lt;a href="https://simonwillison.net/2026/May/12/datasette/#atom-everything"&gt;阅读原文&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://simonwillison.net/2026/May/12/datasette/#atom-everything</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 12 May 2026 23:41:06 +0000</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>[翻译] Simon Willison: CSP 白名单实验</title>
      <link>https://simonwillison.net/2026/May/13/csp-allow/#atom-everything</link>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;标签:&lt;/strong&gt; #CSP #沙箱 #白名单&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;摘要:&lt;/strong&gt; 该实验展示了一种在CSP保护的沙盒iframe中动态管理外部请求的方案：通过自定义fetch()拦截连接错误并上报父窗口，从而提示用户将受阻域名添加至允许列表并刷新页面。该工具由作者使用GPT-5.5 xhigh在Codex桌面应用中开发。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="color:#888;font-size:13px;"&gt;原标题: CSP Allow-list Experiment&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr/&gt;
&lt;h3 style="margin:24px 0 12px;"&gt;Tool:CSP Allow-list Experiment&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style="color:#2c2c2e;margin:4px 0 24px;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;"&gt;工具：CSP 允许列表实验&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div style="color:#9a9ea6;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;margin:20px 0 6px;"&gt;An experiment that shows that you can load an app in a &lt;strong style="color:#c0392b;background:#fdf2f2;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;"&gt;CSP&lt;/strong&gt;-protected &lt;strong style="color:#c0392b;background:#fdf2f2;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;"&gt;sandboxed iframe&lt;/strong&gt; (seeprevious note) and have acustomfetch()that intercepts CSP errors and passes them up to the &lt;strong style="color:#c0392b;background:#fdf2f2;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;"&gt;parent window&lt;/strong&gt;... which can then prompt the user to add that domain to an &lt;strong style="color:#c0392b;background:#fdf2f2;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;"&gt;allow-list&lt;/strong&gt; and then refresh the page.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p style="color:#2c2c2e;margin:4px 0 24px;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;"&gt;该实验展示了如何在一个受 &lt;strong style="color:#c0392b;background:#fdf2f2;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;"&gt;CSP&lt;/strong&gt;（内容安全策略）保护的 &lt;strong style="color:#c0392b;background:#fdf2f2;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;"&gt;sandboxed iframe&lt;/strong&gt;（沙盒 iframe，参见前文）中加载应用，并通过自定义的 &lt;code style="background:#f0f0f5;padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;font-size:13px;"&gt;fetch()&lt;/code&gt; 方法拦截 CSP 错误，将其上报给 &lt;strong style="color:#c0392b;background:#fdf2f2;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;"&gt;parent window&lt;/strong&gt;（父窗口）……随后父窗口可提示用户将该域名添加至 &lt;strong style="color:#c0392b;background:#fdf2f2;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;"&gt;allow-list&lt;/strong&gt;（允许列表），并刷新页面。&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;img src="https://static.simonwillison.net/static/2026/csp-allow.jpg" alt="Screenshot of a web tool titled &amp;quot;CSP Allow-list Experiment&amp;quot; with buttons Reset sample, Clear allow-list, Refresh preview. Left panel shows HTML source code starting with &amp;lt;!doctype html&amp;gt;. Right panel shows Preview with CSP header default-src 'none'; script-src 'unsafe-inline'; style-s... and heading &amp;quot;Sandbox fetch test&amp;quot;. A modal dialog from tools.simonwillison.net is overlaid reading: &amp;quot;The sandbox tried to connect to: https://api.inaturalist.org   Add this origin to the CSP connect-src allow-list and refresh the page?&amp;quot; with an unchecked checkbox &amp;quot;Don't allow tools.simonwillison.net to prompt you again&amp;quot; and Cancel and OK buttons. Below is &amp;quot;Messages from sandbox&amp;quot; showing fetch-catch blocked https://api.inaturalist.org/v1/observations?per... connect-src · https://api.inaturalist.org. At the bottom left is &amp;quot;Allowed fetch() origins&amp;quot; with an input field containing https://api.github.com, an Add button, and a tag https://api.github.com x." style="max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;margin:12px 0;"/&gt;

&lt;img src="https://static.simonwillison.net/static/2026/csp-allow.jpg" alt="Screenshot of a web tool titled &amp;quot;CSP Allow-list Experiment&amp;quot; with buttons Reset sample, Clear allow-list, Refresh preview. Left panel shows HTML source code starting with &amp;lt;!doctype html&amp;gt;. Right panel shows Preview with CSP header default-src 'none'; script-src 'unsafe-inline'; style-s... and heading &amp;quot;Sandbox fetch test&amp;quot;. A modal dialog from tools.simonwillison.net is overlaid reading: &amp;quot;The sandbox tried to connect to: https://api.inaturalist.org   Add this origin to the CSP connect-src allow-list and refresh the page?&amp;quot; with an unchecked checkbox &amp;quot;Don't allow tools.simonwillison.net to prompt you again&amp;quot; and Cancel and OK buttons. Below is &amp;quot;Messages from sandbox&amp;quot; showing fetch-catch blocked https://api.inaturalist.org/v1/observations?per... connect-src · https://api.inaturalist.org. At the bottom left is &amp;quot;Allowed fetch() origins&amp;quot; with an input field containing https://api.github.com, an Add button, and a tag https://api.github.com x." style="max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;margin:12px 0;"/&gt;

&lt;div style="color:#9a9ea6;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;margin:20px 0 6px;"&gt;I built this one with &lt;strong style="color:#2471a3;background:#eaf4fd;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;"&gt;GPT-5.5 xhigh&lt;/strong&gt; running in the &lt;strong style="color:#2471a3;background:#eaf4fd;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;"&gt;Codex&lt;/strong&gt; desktop app.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p style="color:#2c2c2e;margin:4px 0 24px;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;"&gt;我使用运行在 &lt;strong style="color:#2471a3;background:#eaf4fd;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;"&gt;Codex&lt;/strong&gt; 桌面应用中的 &lt;strong style="color:#2471a3;background:#eaf4fd;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;"&gt;GPT-5.5 xhigh&lt;/strong&gt; 构建了该工具。&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div style="color:#9a9ea6;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;margin:20px 0 6px;"&gt;Tags:&lt;strong style="color:#c0392b;background:#fdf2f2;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;"&gt;content-security-policy&lt;/strong&gt;,&lt;strong style="color:#c0392b;background:#fdf2f2;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;"&gt;iframes&lt;/strong&gt;,&lt;strong style="color:#c0392b;background:#fdf2f2;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;"&gt;security&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
